    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690010/extras/556d630bf6c3ae204d5ce895df76f7f8.avif?t=1752823512\" width=600 height=225 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690010/extras/b0add36db5f531539e0345c0b03b97bc.avif?t=1752823512\" width=600 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The freelance Handyman is here AGAIN!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, he received an usual repair task and headed to the client's house. After fixing the toilet and conducting a flush test, the toilet emitted a radiant glow, sucking him into a mysterious portal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon opening his eyes, he found himself in a village in a different world. A woman approached him, saying, &quot;You've finally arrived... The legendary handyman, is it you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690010/extras/fd30335360ecf57c9451315e640b8c4c.avif?t=1752823512\" width=600 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this realm, the Handyman must take on various odd jobs to make ends meet.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it's assisting at the blacksmith's forge, serving as a waiter in the tavern, helping nuns organize shelves in the church, and more. But that's not all \u2013 he even finds himself accompanying adventurers on monster-slaying quests! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690010/extras/e04ea54074e115b48a1b08c7889f8082.avif?t=1752823512\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The handyman works at the bar, assisting catgirl, all the while providing special &quot;services&quot; on the side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690010/extras/5a7f7aeb96eae89680e8a4affbaaad78.avif?t=1752823512\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doesn't have fighting skill but is willing to take damages?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690010/extras/12dae9b2a35044118457e75018d1790e.avif?t=1752823512\" width=600 height=160 /></span>The game offers unique and independent storylines for each girl, along with distinct mini-games related to their respective occupations, playful interactions, intimate scenes, and large-scale CG illustrations. As the affection level reaches a certain point, players can unlock special &quot;corruption&quot; modes for an added dimension to the gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690010/extras/c2a898225f48e512aa9138fa214fd995.avif?t=1752823512\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To improve your character's abilities, in addition to purchasing props in shops and mystery shops, you can also unlock new functions and gain skill points through the &quot;sexy energy&quot; that is regularly turned over to the succubus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to conquer all the characters and find a way back to the real world?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690010/extras/d407d46ca220c46a243fc9df9371565a.avif?t=1752823512\" width=600 height=338 /></span>You get to buy various items in the shop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690010/extras/d2904859074ce5ad2af72cd23c360192.poster.avif?t=1752823512\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690010/extras/d2904859074ce5ad2af72cd23c360192.webm?t=1752823512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690010/extras/d2904859074ce5ad2af72cd23c360192.mp4?t=1752823512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You need to \u201cpay off\u201d to the succubus on a weekly basis LOL!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690010/extras/29668e5a05642fbe5dc892c2fb907061.avif?t=1752823512\" width=600 height=160 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690010/extras/dd9513ed61fb28a309353077caf75046.poster.avif?t=1752823512\" width=600 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690010/extras/dd9513ed61fb28a309353077caf75046.webm?t=1752823512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Tavern\u2019s most popular Maid \u2013 Cat girl, Sunny</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loves booze, always up for a drink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If she gets wasted? well, It's party time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690010/extras/bb7ba19631c56c0621742e23b9f49d97.poster.avif?t=1752823512\" width=600 height=301 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690010/extras/bb7ba19631c56c0621742e23b9f49d97.webm?t=1752823512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Blacksmith Shop Owner \u2013 Mrs. Minotaur</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minotaur hubby loves smithing, not her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frustrated housewife, nowhere to vent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690010/extras/0b116d6a4528da5dbad0e1671cf26937.poster.avif?t=1752823512\" width=600 height=287 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690010/extras/0b116d6a4528da5dbad0e1671cf26937.webm?t=1752823512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Adventurer \u2013 Elf</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tsundere, terrible attitude, solo forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Has a lewd crest\u2014gets stronger when horny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690010/extras/53bf124093fcddf703b25b4f7eaad10a.poster.avif?t=1752823512\" width=600 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690010/extras/53bf124093fcddf703b25b4f7eaad10a.webm?t=1752823512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Nun \u2013 Curious About Forbidden Desires</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Found Sister\u2019s Secret Smut in the library.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes writes confession in her diary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690010/extras/aa78a5f28a039ef36b733078d6d0f691.poster.avif?t=1752823512\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690010/extras/aa78a5f28a039ef36b733078d6d0f691.webm?t=1752823512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Succubus \u2013 ???</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Needs lewd energy, tricks you to help her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After interactive with girls, she can drains the lewd energy from you afterwards.</p>",
